<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 68,109 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 68,109 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 68,109 bags in the week ending December 1 compared to 125,494 bags in the corresponding week to December 3 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,249,980 bags against 1,692,583 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
